  "title": "White Potato Pie",
  "description": "White potatoes are cooked, mashed and combined with sugar, butter, whipping cream, eggs, lemon rind, lemon juice, vanilla and a few other tasty ingredients. This unusual-but-delicious concoction is spooned into a prepared pie shell and baked until set.",
